## 1. Executive Summary

LoopLedger is a hackathon prototype for making AI-assisted lending recommendations and human review actions more reviewable. It combines a risk gate, a persisted review queue, reviewer oversight indicators and an event-chain consistency check.

The indicators are investigatory signals only, not proof that oversight was effective. The audit trail and report do not establish legal compliance or fitness for real lending.

