## 7. Follow-up Actions

1. Validate the complete connected prediction, database, human-review and export workflow using representative end-to-end tests.
2. Validate risk-gate thresholds and gold controls with appropriate subject-matter experts and relevant datasets.
3. Assess whether and how the EU AI Act and applicable data-protection requirements apply to a specific deployment.
4. Implement access controls, externally anchored audit logs, retention controls and governance before production use.
5. Replace sequential backend reads with one transaction-consistent report query if production-grade attestations are required.
